[TagEditModal.vue#L119-L123](file:///c:/S2TT/auto_test/ver8/main/intelligent_audio_test/Intelligent-Audio-TEST/frontend/src/components/common/modal/TagEditModal.vue#L119-L123) 和 [TagCategoryModal.vue#L115-L119](file:///c:/S2TT/auto_test/ver8/main/intelligent_audio_test/Intelligent-Audio-TEST/frontend/src/components/common/modal/TagCategoryModal.vue#L115-L119)：

